        "value": "込高新田改出　五千三百六十石六才（斗八升五合六才）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "込高（新田改出）五千三百六十石六斗八升五合六才"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Added yield revised out from newly reclaimed fields: 5,360.68506 koku. The label is set as two half-width columns, 込高 on the right and 新田改出 on the left. The figure is split across two type sizes: the full-size run prints 五千三百六十石六才, and a small parenthesised note beside it prints 斗八升五合六才, so the sub-koku tail reads 六斗八升五合六才. Only with that tail do the three components add to the gross yield exactly."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "込高新田改出"
